cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you cite the Coaching Trust Framework, please use these metadata. Cite the version you read; drafts change."
type: dataset
title: "Coaching Trust Framework (CTF): an open draft standard for testing AI coaching agents"
abstract: >-
  Draft requirements, language rules and evaluation protocol for testing, from the
  outside, whether AI coaching agents respect safeguards drawn from the norms of the
  coaching profession (version 0: French-language agents used in France). Test
  reports only; no certification.
authors:
